    "detailed_description": "A card game in which the goal is to correctly predict the next card. If the player fails to do so, they are punished and must try again.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe rules of this game are quite simple.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne player starts by guessing whether the next card will be higher or black. If the player fails to make a correct prediction, they are punished (e.g., take a sip of a drink) and must try again.<br />\r\nThis continues until the player makes a correct prediction. Once the player has guessed the correct card, they get to choose who will guess the next card.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecial rules can be found in the game, so there's no need to memorize them separately.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the deck is empty and players want to continue playing, they can shuffle the cards again.",
    "about_the_game": "A card game in which the goal is to correctly predict the next card. If the player fails to do so, they are punished and must try again.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe rules of this game are quite simple.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nOne player starts by guessing whether the next card will be higher or black. If the player fails to make a correct prediction, they are punished (e.g., take a sip of a drink) and must try again.<br />\r\nThis continues until the player makes a correct prediction. Once the player has guessed the correct card, they get to choose who will guess the next card.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSpecial rules can be found in the game, so there's no need to memorize them separately.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIf the deck is empty and players want to continue playing, they can shuffle the cards again.",
    "short_description": "A card game where the objective is to correctly predict the next card. If one fails to do so, they will be punished and have to try again.",
